  "note" : {
    "@language" : "en",
    "@value" : "water glass; formerly used in tuberculosis, bronchial asthma, arteriosclerosis, & as topical antiseptic; irritating & caustic to skin, mucous membranes; if swallowed, causes vomiting & diarrhea; RN given refers to silicic acid, Na salt"
  },
